   "en": "As New Zealand, control and own the states of Brabant (Zeeland) and Sjaelland (Zealand)."
  },
  {
   "k": "1h0k7yc",
   "en": "Strategy"
  },
  {
   "k": "1dlhs08",
   "en": "Best done with historical focuses off except for German AI. Make sure the UK goes Fascist or Monarchist. Go down the fascist path and time the justification so that by the time Germany attacks Poland you have a wargoal on the Netherlands and Poland. Make sure to take all the decisions to purchase ships from the UK, USA and Germany. Declare on Poland first, this will let you join the Axis. Move your army on the Dutch border and declare war on the Netherlands. Use naval invasions if need be and annex everything. Repeat the same process for Denmark. If everything went right there should be no enemy faction involved, especially if you don't call Germany into the war."
  },
  {
   "k": "7fzil5",
   "en": "Alternatively, a slightly less RNG reliant method can be done by going communist in historical mode."
  },
  {
   "k": "1gaqfls",
   "en": "Can be done before WW2, rush the civil war, then hire the army advisor ASAP to take the +500 weekly manpower spirit. Start justifying on Denmark around late 1937, and go down the naval tree to get decisions to buy ships, they will be enough for naval superiority. Move your ships and army to Leningrad before declaring war and time the focus to join Comintern to end right after you declare war. Then justify on Netherlands and leave the Comintern to be able to declare on them, they should be weak enough to handle without Soviets' help. Make you sure you build marines and don't take any other focuses as you lack political power."
  },
  {
   "k": "17v4xqg",
   "en": "Alternatively, don't join the Comintern and start justifying on Denmark at around 1941, and line up your declaration with the time the Germans declare on the Soviets - this will let you join the comintern while bypassing their war declaration restrictions (this will also call Japan into the war, but they will never reach you on historical). From here, you just need to do a D-Day into the Netherlands and hold it until the end of the war, while gathering enough warscore to annex it once the peace deal comes. You can grant military access to allies members to assist with holding. Being in the comintern will allow you to annex an allied Netherlands, as long as youre at least partially occupying them at the time of the peace deal."
  },
  {
